{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient TD \u2013 A Mythological Co-op Tower Defense Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense Reimagined</strong><br>Build and upgrade powerful towers inspired by ancient gods and heroes. Each tower has unique abilities to help you face an onslaught of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op</strong> <br>Play solo or team up with up to 3 other players. Combine towers, coordinate artifacts, and support each other with unique peasants and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Setting</strong><br>Fight in a world rooted in ancient mythology. Face legendary beasts, cursed warriors, and divine challenges as you defend your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Peasants</strong><br>Peasants are unlockable characters that grant powerful passive skills. Choose one at the start of each match to drastically change your strategy and enhance gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Challenges</strong><br>Powerful challenge monsters roam the battlefield. Defeat them to choose from random artifacts that grant game-changing effects for the rest of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Collection System</strong><br>Collect permanent stat-boosting runes through treasure rewards. Customize your playstyle and grow stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Items and Treasures</strong><br>Unlock and equip a wide variety of unique items, each with its own stats and effects. Synergize your gear with tower types and peasant skills for maximum power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode \u2013 Ultimate Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating all standard waves, enter Endless Mode. Push to Wave 100 to unlock the highest rewards and maximum difficulty scaled to your time spent.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic